WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.860 --> 00:00:11.567
Choose a floor for a room, for example "1st floor".

2
00:00:12.067 --> 00:00:18.529
On the floor card, the floor below appears faintly under the drawing.

3
00:00:19.029 --> 00:00:29.974
Open the ground floor and choose a type of stairs, for example "+ Straight stairs".

4
00:00:30.474 --> 00:00:37.253
Drag the stairs into place; the number of treads follows from the height.

5
00:00:37.753 --> 00:00:47.280
The stairwell opening in the floor above is drawn automatically.

6
00:00:47.780 --> 00:00:56.338
Tap "House in 3D": all floors on top of each other, with the stairs.

7
00:00:56.838 --> 00:01:15.042
Tap "Walk through the house" and use W and the arrow keys to walk up the stairs.

